that girl with the nails?

00:05:08.975 --> 00:05:11.077
No, bring your ass in here.

00:05:11.077 --> 00:05:13.179
No. No.
The blonde chick?

00:05:13.179 --> 00:05:16.048
No. Come here.
Come here. Let me smell you."

00:05:16.048 --> 00:05:18.517
[ Laughter ]

00:05:18.517 --> 00:05:20.085
-This is also very exciting --

00:05:20.085 --> 00:05:21.787
