00:05:26.793 --> 00:05:28.727
Okay. Uh...

00:05:28.727 --> 00:05:30.629
Atlantic City. I know I'm going
to be in Atlantic City.

00:05:30.629 --> 00:05:32.298
-You know what? We're going to
throw it up on the screen.

00:05:32.298 --> 00:05:33.933 line:0%
-Please do.
I wish you would have said that

00:05:33.933 --> 00:05:35.668 line:0%
